`,l.jsx(n.h3,{id:"is-it-open-source",children:"Is it open source?"}),`
`,l.jsx(n.p,{children:"Yes. SeoTool.im is open source, so you can self-host the whole thing for free, including the Search Console MCP. The one-click connection here uses SeoTool.im's hosted Google app. If you self-host, you bring your own Google OAuth client, the same Cloud-console step the hosted version saves you. Hosted means no setup; self-hosted means full control."}),`
